      "content": "ring: a circular band of metal (latten, tin, iron, copper) — door rings and knockers, curtain rings, and rings for closing pouches and bags; also occasionally a coil of wire equivalent to 1/2 cwt. Finger rings (jewellery) are catalogued under finger ring."
